@baseUrl = http://localhost:5035
@token = replace-with-local-access-token
@seriesId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Entire-series progress, including released specials (requires a real catalog series ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/series/{{seriesId}}/progress?provider=tmdb
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid provider returns 400 for an authenticated request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/series/{{seriesId}}/progress?provider=invalid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Anonymous requests return 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/series/{{seriesId}}/progress
